          <li>Built internal automation tools and Python GUI apps to streamline student-hiring & operations workflows.</li>
          <li>Designed HR data validation systems with senior staff.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="font-bold">Lead Development Engineer — Barclays</h3>
        <div class="text-neutral-400 text-sm">Pune, India • Apr 2023 – May 2024</div>
